stateDiagram-v2
direction TB
    [*] --> awaiting_review : task enters delivery Done / surface review card
    awaiting_review --> in_review : reviewer submits [quorum not met]
    awaiting_review --> awaiting_response : reviewer submits [quorum met]
    in_review --> awaiting_response : remaining reviewer submits / quorum met

    awaiting_response --> done : reviewee accepts [quorum met]
    awaiting_response --> disputed : reviewee responds
    disputed --> reported : participant reports

    reported --> ai_reviewing : System Admin starts AI advisory
    ai_reviewing --> reported : signed callback stores advice
    reported --> resolved : System Admin resolves
    ai_reviewing --> resolved : System Admin resolves

    done --> [*]
    resolved --> [*]

    note right of awaiting_review
        Canonical UI:
        /projects/:projectId/reviews/tasks
        All eight states remain visible as Kanban lanes.
    end note
